# ---- Local runtime + secrets ----
# The client keeps its settings under the OS config dir, never next to the binary,
# but these can still show up during local runs. Never commit them: pre-rewrite
# settings.json held (weakly) encrypted broker and bot tokens.
settings.json
columns.json
WindowPos.json
*.log
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

